,"mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001:m0017"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-xieshu-ws2190655","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001","quote":"純","mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001:m0023"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-xieshu-ws2190655","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001","quote":"純","mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001:m0037"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-xieshu-ws2190655","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001","quote":"純","mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001:m0057"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-xieshu-ws2190655","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001","quote":"純","mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001:m0149"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"《南史》卷十九：字景懋、景仁弟，為劉毅衛軍長史、南平相，江陵兵敗遇害；固定《宋書》卷五十二同官、同字、同事。","family_path":{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_AB","source_assertion_id":null,"parent_connection":{"type":"shared_father_through_siblings","sibling_assertion_ids":["a-nanshi019-chun-yu-younger"],"sibling_father_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-yu-yun-father"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001","quote":"純字景懋，景仁弟也。劉毅鎮江陵，以爲衛軍長史、南平相。及王鎮惡襲毅，毅時病，佐史聞兵至，馳還入府，左右引車欲還外廨，純叱之曰：「我人吏也，逃欲安之。」及入，毅兵敗眾散，純爲人所殺。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xiechun-xiehan:p001:m0005","source_term":"景仁弟也","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-chun-yu-younger"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001","quote":"謝裕字景仁，朗弟允之子、而晦從父也。名與宋武帝諱同，故以字行。允字令度，位宣城內史。景仁幼爲從祖安所知，始爲前軍行參軍，會稽王世子元顯嬖人張法順權傾一時，內外無不造門，唯景仁不至，年三十而方爲著作佐郎。桓玄誅元顯，見景仁，謂四坐曰：「司馬庶人父子雲何不敗，遂令謝景仁三十而方佐著作郎。」玄建楚臺，以補黃門侍郎。及篡位，領驍騎將軍。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0000","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieyu-descendants:p001:m0008","source_term":"允之子","source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi019-yu-yun-father"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"具名兄弟句逐步連到其中一人的明父；父系為可撤回編輯組裝。"}},{"id":"my8_62g_1b9","label":"謝純妻庾氏","status":"active","historicity":"historical_tradition","aliases":[{"surface":"庾","mention_ids":["c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0061","c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0065","c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001:m0059","c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001:m0063"]}],"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieshu-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001","quote":"庾","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0061"},{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-019","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu","source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieshu-ws1531762","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001","quote":"庾","mention_id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0065"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-xieshu-ws2190655","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001","quote":"庾","mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001:m0059"},{"work_id":"w-songshu","book_id":"b-songshu-052","source_id":"s-songshu-052-xieshu-ws2190655","chapter_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu","paragraph_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001","quote":"庾","mention_id":"c-songshu-052-xieshu:p001:m0063"}],"review":"ai_provisional","identity_note":"述奉兄純喪還都遇風時，純妻庾使人戒述。兩見庾為氏稱，未補其父、名或子女。"}],"source_mention_summary":[{"source_id":"s-nanshi-019-xieshu-ws1531762","work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-01