d":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-052-xieshu-ws2190655"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001","text":"甝弟述字景先，小字道兒。少有至行，隨純在江陵，純遇害，述奉純喪還都，至西塞遇暴風，純喪舫流漂不知所在，述乘小船尋求，經純妻庾舫過。庾遣人謂曰：「小郎去必無及，寧可存亡俱盡邪。」述號泣答曰：「若安全至岸，尙須營理；如其已致意外，述亦無心獨存。」因冒浪而進，見純喪幾沒，述號叫呼天，幸而獲免。咸以爲精誠所致，武帝聞而嘉之。及臨豫州，諷中正以爲迎主簿，甚被器遇。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"start":0,"end":1,"surface":"甝","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0000","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABB","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝甝。"},{"start":2,"end":3,"surface":"述","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0002","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABC","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝述。"},{"start":4,"end":6,"surface":"景先","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0004","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABC","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝述。"},{"start":9,"end":11,"surface":"道兒","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0009","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABC","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝述。"},{"start":18,"end":19,"surface":"純","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0018","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝純。"},{"start":23,"end":24,"surface":"純","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0023","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABA","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝純。"},{"start":27,"end":28,"surface":"述","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0027","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABC","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段敘事與具名角色讀作謝述。"},{"start":29,"end":30,"surface":"純","id":"c-nanshi-019-xieshu:p001:m0029","person_id":"aa6_83c_juy_ABA","kind":